          <Pad Id="T8ThLP9zBfOIXdBqfQ9waj" Bounds="60,95,480,82" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="A Feature is a geometry with a Dictionary of attributes. It is NetTopologySuite's own type - the one VL.GeoJSON reads and VL.Mapsui draws, so all three packages share it without referencing each other.">
